<del></del></span> Recommended Gear for Survival Hunters in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="what-is-the-bis-survival-hunter-gear">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="$color" data-contiguous="true" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/inv_misc_questionmark.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> What is the BiS Survival Hunter gear?</h3>With many different sources of gearing and loot scarcity in Mists of Pandaria Classic, targeting your absolute Best in Slot gear isn't entirely realistic; instead, we've created a Best in Slot list from the ideal Survival Hunter drops found in Phase 5 from raids, dungeons, Reputation, and World Bosses to help you decide what to prioritize.<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>While raid drops are generally the most reliable way of getting high item level gear, many other items can be just as good, if not better, so you should reference the <a data-contiguous="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/guide/classes/hunter/survival/dps-stat-priority-pve">Stat Priorities for Survival Hunters</a> to help determine your own BiS gear based on what is available to you.<ul class="exclude-units"></ul>
<br/>
<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="bis-gear">Overall Best in Slot Gear for Survival Hunters</h3>
<div class="pad exclude-units"></div>This list represents the best overall gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic Phase 5. This comprehensive setup includes items from Throne of Thunder as well as reputation rewards and world bosses. Survival Hunters should prioritize Agility-heavy pieces with Critical Strike and Mastery/<wbr/>Haste Rating to maximize the value of reforging.<br/>
