<del></del></span> Tier &amp; Set Bonuses for Survival Hunters in Mists of Pandaria Classic</span></h2>Tier 16 is a substantial upgrade for Survival, and both bonuses are worth chasing. The 2-piece reduces the cooldown of <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=3045/rapid-fire">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_hunter_runningshot.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rapid Fire</span></a> whenever you cast <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=3044/arcane-shot">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_impalingbolt.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Arcane Shot</span></a> or <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=2643/multi-shot">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_upgrademoonglaive.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Multi-Shot</span></a>, which gives you noticeably more uptime on one of our biggest damage cooldowns. The 4-piece is where the set really pays off, though, and <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=53301/explosive-shot">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_hunter_explosiveshot.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Explosive Shot</span></a> has a 40% chance not to consume a charge of <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=56453/lock-and-load">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_hunter_lockandload.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Lock and Load</span></a>, which roughly doubles the number of free Explosive Shots you get out of a Lock and Load window. You want the full 4-piece even if a couple of off-pieces would otherwise sim higher.<h3 class="heading-size-3 heading-bar" id="tier-16">
