<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_hunter_runningshot.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rapid Fire</span></a>, <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=121818/stampede">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_hunter_bestialdiscipline.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Stampede</span></a>, <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=781/disengage">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_rogue_feint.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Disengage</span></a>, <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=51753/camouflage">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_hunter_displacement.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Camouflage</span></a>, and <a class="icontiny" data-contiguous="true" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/spell=5384/feign-death">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_rogue_feigndeath.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Feign Death</span></a>, while also providing one of the strongest Agility procs in the game on an internal cooldown. Prioritise getting this trinket.</div></li></ul>
<ul class="exclude-units">
