<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_hunter_runningshot.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rapid Fire</span></a> windows. It should be your second trinket of choice.</div></li></ul>
